    r1 = moire on the checker lawn
    r2 = broken power lines (thinner than a pixel)
    r3 = picket fence: slats merge and alias
    r4 = spokes: jagged and broken
    r5 = checkered ball: texture aliasing
    r6 = jagged silhouette edges (crate)
